  "content": {
    "en": "EasyUI is an open-source registry of over 130 meticulously crafted, animated React components built with Tailwind CSS and Framer Motion. Engineered for copy-paste ownership through the shadcn CLI, it features physical spring micro-interactions, dark-mode-first elevated surfaces, and comprehensive components ranging from AI interaction streams to tactile input controls.",
    "zh": "EasyUI 是一个收录超 130 款精雕细琢的现代 React 动效组件库与开放注册表。全库基于 Tailwind CSS 与 Framer Motion 构建，深度兼容 shadcn CLI 解耦分发机制，支持源码级一键导入。其设计兼具极简黑白视觉美感与细腻的物理弹簧微交互，涵盖 AI 流式响应面板、拟真控制旋钮、数据热力图及交互卡片等多类前沿交互模式。"
  },
